# A save made on another island: what the player is told, through the real keys.
#
# A save keeps only its seed and grows the world again when it is opened, so a
# build whose landscape registry has moved makes a DIFFERENT island from that
# seed (adding salt_flats and scrapwood moved 9% of every world's tiles). The
# save is not opened onto ground that moved; it is named, and the reason is on
# the glass. Three commands, because the fixture is a save written by an older
# build and no boot flag may fake one:
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/saves.tour --saves=saves-elsewhere --seed=1 --hour=10 \
#     --weather=clear:0 --give=driftwood:6,stone:4
#   godot --headless --path . -s tests/save/stale_save.gd -- saves-elsewhere 1
#   tools/tour.sh tours/saves-elsewhere.tour --saves=saves-elsewhere --seed=1 \
#     --hour=10 --weather=clear:0
#
# Step 1 plays a little and writes slot 1 and the autosave, both with their own
# picture of the world. Step 2 takes slot 1 back to a version-1 file — which is
# exactly what every save already on a player's disk is. Step 3 is this tour.
coast calm
# Patient at the start. The runner gives the loading page 30 s to lift and then
# goes on regardless, so on a machine running several builders at once a shot
# taken too early is a picture of the page and not of the slate; and `choose`
# walks the rows until it finds one, so a page that has not opened yet hangs the
# tour rather than failing it. Four seconds covers both. Read the frames.
wait 4
tap pause
wait 1
choose saves
tap use
await app:saves 4
wait 0.4
# Right turns the app from saving to loading.
tap move_right
wait 0.4
choose slot_1
wait 0.5
# The game is still there — its picture, its day, where it stood — and under it
# the whole reason this build will not open it.
shot 01-another-island
tap use
wait 0.8
# Pressing load anyway: refused, and said again on the key strip.
shot 02-refused
# The autosave in the same folder was written by THIS build, on THIS island, and
# still opens: nothing was broken for the saves that are still this world's.
choose slot_0
wait 0.4
shot 03-the-one-that-still-opens
tap use
await game 30
coast calm
wait 4
shot 04-loaded
